---
import SectionDots from "./section-dots.astro";
---

<section id="invest" class="my-20">
  <div class="border-t border-b px-4">
    <div
      class="relative mx-auto grid w-full max-w-6xl grid-cols-1 gap-12 border-r border-l px-4 py-30 md:grid-cols-2 md:px-12 md:py-40"
    >
      <div
        class="bg-background absolute top-0 right-0 z-20 flex h-[20px] w-[20px] translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 items-center justify-center rounded-full"
      >
        <div class="bg-brand-wine-red h-[2px] w-[2px] rounded-full"></div>
      </div>

      <div
        class="bg-background absolute top-0 left-0 z-20 flex h-[20px] w-[20px] -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 items-center justify-center rounded-full"
      >
        <div class="bg-brand-wine-red h-[2px] w-[2px] rounded-full"></div>
      </div>

      <h2 class="text-4xl font-medium">
        Taking off the ground requires both speed and direction.
      </h2>

      <p class="text-muted-foreground text-lg">
        It takes courage to set the course and a powerful engine to drive
        forward. The same applies to business – and this has always been the
        case for Jørgen Andersen.
      </p>

      <SectionDots />
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="border-b px-4">
    <div
      class="relative mx-auto grid w-full max-w-6xl grid-cols-1 gap-12 border-r border-l px-4 py-30 md:grid-cols-2 md:px-12 md:py-40"
    >
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-medium">A new chapter.</h2>

      <div>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground mb-2 text-lg">
          After more than 60 years of innovation, growth, and technological
          development with JAI A/S, Jørgen has passed the company on.
        </p>
        <p class="text-muted-foreground text-lg">
          Going forward, his focus will be on future investments under the name <strong
            >ig9tor invest.</strong
          >
        </p>
      </div>

      <SectionDots />
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="border-b px-4">
    <div
      class="border-lpx-4 relative mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl border-r border-l px-4 px-12 py-30 text-center md:px-40 md:py-40"
    >
      <p class="mb-12 text-4xl font-medium">
        We believe in visionary people, technological advancement, and
        investments that make <em>a real difference</em>.
      </p>
      <p class="text-muted-foreground text-4xl font-medium">
        Our journey continues – and we look forward to taking the next step
        together with you.
      </p>

      <SectionDots />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
